<title>USA: Colchester, Vt., firm might need to add jobs.</title>
<headline>Colchester, Vt., firm might need to add jobs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A jump in overseas orders for metal casting machines could translate into an unspecified number of new jobs at a Colchester, Vt., company, according to officials from Hazelett Strip Casting.</p>
<p>The firm said it has received orders worth $6 million to deliver industrial machinery to China, Japan, Indonesia, Mexico and Quebec.</p>
<p>Hazelett Marketing Director Peter Regan said the firm now has 110 employees, explaining the new orders meant that sixty Hazelett metal casting machines will be operating in 26 countries by 1998.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
